        ("Passion is one of the most important qualities in a leader. Without passion, it’s hard to build an argument that will compel people to follow you. Once you’ve found your passion, identify your vision and communicate it to your team in an inspiring way.", "Yaniv Altshuler"),
        ("We adopted the love at first sight approach to hiring. That means we only hire people whose eyes glitter with the realization that what we’re building is amazing.", "Yaniv Altshuler"),
