        ("Our battle with our enemy is great...this is a battle between Islam and unbelief on this land. In this battle, the crusaders united with the World Zionism.'Mr. Bush. These decisions and statements will only lead you to the garbage can of history.' April 2004", "Ibrahim Mudeiris"),
