        ("Cassandra: Told you I'd get you in and out without anyone knowing. Piece of cake.\nRapunzel: Piece of cake!? Piece of cake? Uh, did you see the 70 feet of my father's going to kill me coming from my head?\nCassandra: One problem at a time!", "Tangled: Before Ever After"),
        ("Cassandra: So what are going for here? Maybe a bob, a pixie?\nRapunzel: Just cut it!\nCassandra: Uh no.\nRapunzel: What do you mean uh oh? There shouldn't be any uh ohs. Uh oh.", "Tangled: Before Ever After"),
