        ("The word (classical) carries the implication that the works of art and literature produced in Graeco-Roman antiquity possess an absolute value, that they form the standard by which all others are to be judged.", "Jasper Griffin"),
        ("Greek culture was competitive. Each successive historian and philosopher made a point of showing how he improved on his predecessor.", "Jasper Griffin"),
        ("Look around and you will see them. The drowned, the sick, the slain. Here they lie, rotting in the field and river of Hel. But the dead don't always lie still here. This is not a place of rest.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("You might think she's brave to go on this journey on her own. But it isn't bravery that drives her. Bravery only means something to those afraid of death. Senua's fear runs far, far deeper.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("Senua pushes away a world that conspired to cause so much suffering. There is nothing to go back to and worse to look forward to.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("The darkness is coming. It yearns for life, hungers for it - like a pack of wolves on a hunt. But she's not stopping. Not this time.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("A vision, of what's to come? Poor Senua. The darkness does not bargain. It does not reason. It is rot. And now it has taken hold, it will spread towards her head, the seat of the soul, until there is nothing left of her. All of her suffering will have been for nothing. It's just a matter of time.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("The hardest battles are fought in the mind. That is what Dillion taught her. With every defeat, the dark rot will grow and soon it will take her soul. But, for now at least, she still has control of her mind. And she will fulfill her vow, whatever the cost.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("Have you died before? It's a serious question. When the illusion of self is shattered, you simply cease to be. Though it may not seem that way to others, you know when it is true. You can feel it, a stranger in your own body, an imposter and nothing is the same ever again.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("It's funny. We all want to see behind the veil, don't we? But once we do... we mostly just close our eyes again and pretend what we saw was never really there.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("This is the price she pays for seeing things differently. Because once you gaze into the relentless darkness, all that lurks within it can see you too.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
        ("The worst kind comes without warning, a deep and primal signal from within. A reminder that just because you cannot see the threat, it doesn't mean that it's not already here.", "Hellblade: Senua's Sacrifice"),
